@startuml job-lifecycle
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #DBEAFE
skinparam stateBorderColor #64748B
skinparam stateFontColor #0F172A
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFBEB
skinparam noteBorderColor #D4AF37
skinparam titleFontSize 23
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 40
hide empty description
title Job Lifecycle and Quality Gate\n<size:14>Workflow stages; job state and stage-task state are tracked separately</size>

state "ACCEPTED\nCompleted upload + enabled profile\nAtomic job and first task creation" as Accepted
state "PREPARE / CPU\nInspect, deduplicate, check 100-1,000 valid images\nFreeze grouped training / held-out split" as Prepare
state "CAPTION / GPU / optional\nGenerate content-focused descriptions\nFreeze versioned training manifest" as Caption #F3E8FF
state "TRAIN / GPU / candidate 0\nWait for compatible shared slot\nTrain adapter and checkpoint" as Train #F3E8FF
state "EVALUATE / GPU / candidate 0\nFixed prompts, seeds and held-out references\nReload exact saved adapter + inference smoke test" as Eval #F3E8FF
state "TRAIN + EVALUATE / GPU / candidate 1\nOne prevalidated quality remediation\nSame evaluation policy and thresholds\nEach stage reacquires a shared GPU slot" as Retry #F3E8FF
state "PUBLISH / CPU\nVerify artifact and evaluation checksums\nGuard current attempt and cancellation\nAtomic model READY + job READY" as Publish #DCFCE7
state "READY\nAdapter + base revision + loading manifest\nEvaluation report and authorized download" as Ready #DCFCE7
state "FAILED\nActionable technical / data error" as Failed #FEE2E2
state "QUALITY_REJECTED\nFailed dimensions in report\nNo published model" as Rejected #FEE2E2

[*] --> Accepted
Accepted --> Prepare
Prepare --> Caption : Valid data; captions needed
Prepare --> Train : Valid data; captions present
Prepare -right-> Failed : Invalid / unsuitable data
Caption --> Train
Train --> Eval : Saved candidate
Eval --> Publish : All dimensions + smoke pass
Eval -right-> Retry : Remediable metric failure\nBudget permits candidate 1
Eval --> Rejected : Metric failure; no remediation
Retry --> Publish : All dimensions + smoke pass
Retry --> Rejected : Metric failure again
Publish --> Ready
Ready --> [*]

note left of Train
All GPU stages share the same 2-4 slots.
No device is dedicated to evaluation.
GPU waiting is a PENDING stage task,
not additional active GPU execution.
end note

legend bottom left
  Common to every stage:
  * Infrastructure retry: max 3 attempts per task, within cumulative GPU budget.
  * Technical / exhausted-budget errors -> FAILED, never a quality pass.
  * CANCEL_REQUESTED -> CANCELLED only after executor termination is confirmed.
  * Old fencing tokens cannot commit progress or publish a model.
  A screen may reject early; only the full calibrated policy can pass a candidate.
endlegend
@enduml
